  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for UPC-E from Excel is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan UPC-E barcode from Excel in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode UPC-E data message from Excel file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
